{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE5L0Jsb29kJTIwVmVzc2VsJTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Blood Vessel","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/kavmE1zj7w3KaaG1NMXp1lZGLZV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dRcKurfJXO3hH6EVFjA4TwGXbFw.jpg","description":"Near the end of World War II, the survivors of a torpedoed hospital ship cling to life aboard a crowded lifeboat. With no food, water, or shelter, all seems lost – until an eerily silent German minesweeper drifts ominously towards them, giving them one last chance at survival. As our motley crew explores the ship, it becomes all too clear that some diabolical fate has befallen its German crew. The mystery only deepens when they encounter a young Romanian girl, apparently the sole survivor, who leads them to a locked room in the bowels of the vessel.\n\nReleased 29 Oct 2020 · Australia · Language: English · 93 min\nStudio: Rock Island Films, Wicked of Oz Studios\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Horror","Fantasy","War","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.3","imdb_id":"tt8009938","moviedb_id":618585,"tmdbId":618585,"runtime":"93 min","cast":["Nathan Phillips","Alyssa Sutherland","Robert Taylor","Christopher Kirby","Alex Cooke","Mark Diaco","John Lloyd Fillingham","Vivienne Perry"],"director":["Justin Dix"],"writer":["Justin Dix","Jordan Prosser"],"released":"2020-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Australia","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Justin Dix","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hiVIsRKPA99fcIzKKhdNlnK1LIe.jpg"},{"name":"Nathan Phillips","character":"Nathan Sinclair","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bxY3LJYgGgnaUrRsK1SHvdomxgc.jpg"},{"name":"Alyssa Sutherland","character":"Jane Prescott","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tPxURKufpOddRYTgg5FuBwNK4iT.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Taylor","character":"Captain Malone","photo":"https:/